  {
   "id": "death-elevator-255717@1.0.5",
   "gameId": "death-elevator-255717",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.5",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-04-17T03:55:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This patch includes new features and several bug fixes :D",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The newest feature added was the Aim Assist option, but I'll list down every change included in this patch!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Features",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bullet tracer: Now every shot leaves a trail so you can adjust your aim on the following shots, helping you to be more accurate",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Aim Assist: You can turn it on and off on the settings menu, the aim assist was mainly designed to provide a better experience to gamepad users but everyone can use it :D",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bullet SFX update: When you shoot a bullet the sound effect is now more exaggerated, making the game more stylish, it also makes it more clear to understand that you can actually shoot bullets: Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Grenade Launcher: An issue that caused the grenade launcher to shoot incorrectly at times has been corrected, now the grenade launcher is consistent and every shot will work correctly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ammo Inconsistency: Some weapons would be empty at 0 ammo and some at 1. Now every weapon has the extra \"zero bullet\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Camera Effect When Jumping: The player could spawn a camera effect by pressing jump on air, leading to some players expecting a double jump. Now the camera effect only happens when you jump off the ground",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted navigation paths: Some areas had a navigation problem where chaser enemies would fall off the top of a building, these navigation paths was corrected so the enemies work better now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shooting while dead: An issue where you kept shooting an automatic weapon after dying was corrected",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
